  "limitations": [
    "Quiet-VM policy includes exact controller instrumentation and does not exclude physical-host Kubernetes activity. Low observed steal does not measure all host scheduling/storage contention.",
    "RPC counters count prepared query/ack calls, not physical packets or network bytes; logical storage bytes are not physical I/O.",
